msgstr "Sintetizator govora ElevenLabs"

msgid "Report ElevenLabs credit usage for the current period"
msgstr "Sporoči porabo kreditov ElevenLabs v trenutnem obdobju"

msgid "Check again which ElevenLabs voices and models this account can use"
msgstr ""
"Znova preveri, katere glasove in modele ElevenLabs lahko uporablja ta račun"

msgid "ElevenLabs API Key"
msgstr "Ključ API za ElevenLabs"

msgid "&API key:"
msgstr "Ključ &API:"

msgid "Paste your ElevenLabs API key first."
msgstr "Najprej prilepite svoj ključ API za ElevenLabs."

msgid "Checking the API key with ElevenLabs..."
msgstr "Preverjanje ključa API pri ElevenLabs..."

msgid "The API key could not be checked. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Ključa API ni bilo mogoče preveriti. Za podrobnosti si oglejte dnevnik NVDA."

msgid "The API key could not be saved. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Ključa API ni bilo mogoče shraniti. Za podrobnosti si oglejte dnevnik NVDA."

msgid "ElevenLabs TTS"
msgstr "ElevenLabs TTS"

msgid "Clear &API key"
msgstr "Počisti ključ &API"

msgid "Set &API key..."
msgstr "Nastavi ključ &API..."

msgid "Clear the ElevenLabs API key? ElevenLabs can't speak until a new key is set."
msgstr "Želite počistiti ključ API za ElevenLabs? ElevenLabs ne bo mogel govoriti, dokler ne nastavite novega ključa."

msgid "The API key could not be cleared. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Ključa API ni bilo mogoče počistiti. Za podrobnosti si oglejte dnevnik NVDA."

msgid "ElevenLabs rejected this API key. Check that it was copied in full and that it is allowed to read voices."
msgstr "ElevenLabs je zavrnil ta ključ API. Preverite, ali je bil kopiran v celoti in ali ima dovoljenje za branje glasov."

msgid "ElevenLabs could not check the key (HTTP {code}). Try again later."
msgstr "ElevenLabs ni mogel preveriti ključa (HTTP {code}). Poskusite znova pozneje."

msgid "Could not reach ElevenLabs to check the key. Check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Z ElevenLabs se ni bilo mogoče povezati za preverjanje ključa. Preverite internetno povezavo in poskusite znova."

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Speech synthesizer driver that streams audio from the ElevenLabs text-to-speech API."
msgstr "Gonilnik govornega sintetizatorja, ki pretaka zvok iz vmesnika API za pretvorbo besedila v govor ElevenLabs."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"All settings and messages within the add-on are now localized.\n"
"If the ElevenLabs API suddenly becomes unavailable during a session, NVDA now reverts to using eSpeak instead of becoming silent."
msgstr ""
"Vse nastavitve in sporočila dodatka so zdaj prevedena.\n"
"Če vmesnik API ElevenLabs med sejo nenadoma postane nedosegljiv, NVDA zdaj preklopi na eSpeak, namesto da utihne."
